# Batch live deploys

Hobby Vercel allows 100 deploys per rolling 24 hours. Every `git push origin main` burns one.

- Finish the work, then **commit locally**. Do not push after every feature, fix, or tweak.
- Push to `main` at most about **once every 30 minutes**, bundling whatever landed since the last push.
- Push immediately only when Martin asks for live, or the change is a production-down hotfix.
- After a push, still verify live SHA matches (see `vercel-live-matches-push.mdc`).
- Be honest when local HEAD is ahead of production. Do not claim it is live.
